🔍 After Adding Your Server

Verify the JSON is valid:
	   python -c "import json; print(json.load(open('examples/example_servers.json')))"

List available servers:
	   python -c "import json; [print(s['name']) for s in json.load(open('examples/example_servers.json'))['servers']]"

Run inspection:
	   python -m src.workflows.mcp_inspector_workflow --server YOUR_SERVER_NAME

Generate the MCP config from Oauth token
	python generate_mcp_config_from_oauth.py oauth_tokens.json \
  --output-dir ./configs \
  --output-file my_mcp_servers.json
